flowchart LR
    TG["Task graph + event journal<br/>(shared record — every pass writes)"]
    RP["ResearchProgram<br/>scope + hypothesis graph"]
    EX["Controller execution<br/>lease-fenced dispatch"]
    EV["Evidence<br/>source outcomes, artifacts"]
    LA["SUPPORT / REFUTED<br/>evidence ladder (REFUTED terminal)"]
    Q5["Q-05 — WHY?<br/>failure classification + actions"]
    Q4["Q-04 — WHAT ELSE?<br/>failure cone + blast radius"]
    Q2["Q-02 — WHAT NEXT?<br/>ActionEvaluation → eligible ordering"]
    DI["Controller dispatch<br/>Q-02 order → task graph again"]

    RP -->|tasks| EX
    EX -->|evidence| EV
    EV -->|rungs| LA
    LA -->|falsification fact| Q5
    Q5 -->|classification| Q4
    Q4 -->|impact view| Q2
    Q2 -->|eligible order| DI
    DI -->|new/updated tasks| RP

    RP -.->|writes| TG
    EX -.->|writes| TG
    EV -.->|writes| TG
    LA -.->|writes| TG
    Q5 -.->|writes| TG
    Q4 -.->|writes| TG
    Q2 -.->|writes| TG
    DI -.->|writes| TG
